    "name": "DYSON ERA IDLE",
    "steam_appid": 3696140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/9eacc6f2b9f2c8f7057b1e060c27ea7f.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=239 /></span> <i><strong>Embark on the Ultimate Galactic Idle Experience</strong></i><strong></strong><br><br><br>Dyson Era Idle is not just another idle game\u2014it's a breathtaking journey through the cosmos, where you'll transform from a humble engineer to the mastermind behind humanity's most ambitious megastructure: the Dyson Sphere.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Key Features</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/5463d833886fec718871d55f767ba313.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Cosmic Scale Progression</strong>: Watch your Dyson Sphere evolve from a mere concept to a massive energy-harvesting marvel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Scientific Accuracy Meets Engaging Gameplay</strong>: Blend real astrophysics with addictive idle game mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Dynamic Visualization</strong>: Every upgrade transforms your cosmic infrastructure in breathtaking detail</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Infinite Scaling</strong>: Push the boundaries of human engineering across multiple technological eras</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unparalleled Visual Spectacle</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/bd843abd5b38b1148250f1891edd3a6e.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to be mesmerized by an unprecedented visualization of cosmic engineering. Unlike traditional idle games, Dyson Era Idle offers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hyper-realistic Dyson Sphere construction mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stunning, dynamically evolving cosmic landscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Intricate, scientifically-inspired visual progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Real-time rendering of massive celestial megastructures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/30ecd753b9ce98e686befddb775a67c1.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=142 /></span><strong>Break free from conventional idle game constraints:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Deeply strategic resource management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complex technological progression systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive astronomical visualization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><i><strong>Cosmic Diversity: Dyson Spheres Across the Universe</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/573f345b44b6d63b4f36b170f8b87eba.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=172 /></span><strong>Embark on an unprecedented cosmic engineering adventure across the most fascinating celestial bodies in the universe:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Construct Dyson Spheres around Red Dwarf Stars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Harness the incredible energy of Wolf-Rayet Stars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the extreme physics of Neutron Stars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Capture the raw power of O-type Main Sequence Stars (Everyone's favorite!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Revolutionary Mini-Game System</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/c9f28b22c07bb0e9887c75d81016e663.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tired of waiting for your next upgrade? Dyson Era Idle introduces a groundbreaking mini-game system that's an entire game package in itself!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Massive, fully-developed mini-games embedded within the core gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complete automation of mini-games for seamless progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each mini-game is meticulously crafted to feel like a standalone experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategically designed to enhance your cosmic engineering journey</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/9eacc6f2b9f2c8f7057b1e060c27ea7f.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=239 /></span> <i><strong>Embark on the Ultimate Galactic Idle Experience</strong></i><strong></strong><br><br><br>Dyson Era Idle is not just another idle game\u2014it's a breathtaking journey through the cosmos, where you'll transform from a humble engineer to the mastermind behind humanity's most ambitious megastructure: the Dyson Sphere.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Key Features</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/5463d833886fec718871d55f767ba313.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Cosmic Scale Progression</strong>: Watch your Dyson Sphere evolve from a mere concept to a massive energy-harvesting marvel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Scientific Accuracy Meets Engaging Gameplay</strong>: Blend real astrophysics with addictive idle game mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Dynamic Visualization</strong>: Every upgrade transforms your cosmic infrastructure in breathtaking detail</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Infinite Scaling</strong>: Push the boundaries of human engineering across multiple technological eras</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unparalleled Visual Spectacle</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/bd843abd5b38b1148250f1891edd3a6e.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to be mesmerized by an unprecedented visualization of cosmic engineering. Unlike traditional idle games, Dyson Era Idle offers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hyper-realistic Dyson Sphere construction mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stunning, dynamically evolving cosmic landscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Intricate, scientifically-inspired visual progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Real-time rendering of massive celestial megastructures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/30ecd753b9ce98e686befddb775a67c1.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=142 /></span><strong>Break free from conventional idle game constraints:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Deeply strategic resource management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complex technological progression systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive astronomical visualization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><i><strong>Cosmic Diversity: Dyson Spheres Across the Universe</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/573f345b44b6d63b4f36b170f8b87eba.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=172 /></span><strong>Embark on an unprecedented cosmic engineering adventure across the most fascinating celestial bodies in the universe:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Construct Dyson Spheres around Red Dwarf Stars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Harness the incredible energy of Wolf-Rayet Stars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the extreme physics of Neutron Stars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Capture the raw power of O-type Main Sequence Stars (Everyone's favorite!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Revolutionary Mini-Game System</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696140/extras/c9f28b22c07bb0e9887c75d81016e663.avif?t=1750823139\" data-has-big width=800 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tired of waiting for your next upgrade? Dyson Era Idle introduces a groundbreaking mini-game system that's an entire game package in itself!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Massive, fully-developed mini-games embedded within the core gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complete automation of mini-games for seamless progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each mini-game is meticulously crafted to feel like a standalone experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategically designed to enhance your cosmic engineering journey</p>",
    "short_description": "In Dyson Era Idle, harness stellar power to build cosmic megastructures. Research technologies, select unique stars, and construct increasingly efficient Dyson Spheres. Transform theoretical astrophysics into a captivating idle experience of galactic engineering.",
